---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro'
import '../styles/globals.css'
---

<Base
  title="Laso - Recovery, Readiness, and Health Intelligence"
  description="Laso turns Apple Health and wearable data into daily readiness, recovery, sleep, strain, stress, risk signals, and long-term trends with actionable guidance."
>
  <div class="min-h-screen bg-white">

    <!-- ════════ NAV ════════ -->
    <nav aria-label="Main navigation" class="nav-blur fixed top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 border-b border-gray-100/60">
      <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-5 h-12 flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="#" class="text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark">Laso</a>
        <a href="#early-access" class="bg-apple-dark text-white text-xs font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 hover:bg-black transition-colors">
          Get Early Access
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- ════════ HERO ════════ -->
    <section data-section="hero" class="hero-gradient pt-32 pb-16 md:pt-44 md:pb-24 px-5 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-apple-blue/10 text-apple-blue text-sm font-medium rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 bg-apple-blue rounded-full animate-pulse"></span>
        iOS Early Access Open
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-[1.08]">
        Your health data should
        <span class="gradient-text">change your decisions.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-5 text-lg md:text-xl text-apple-secondary max-w-3xl mx-auto text-balance leading-relaxed">
        Laso combines Apple Health and wearable signals into one daily health brief: recovery, readiness, sleep, strain,
        stress, risk signals, and the next best action.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-8 max-w-md mx-auto">
        <form id="hero-form" class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3">
          <input
            type="email"
            placeholder="your@email.com"
            required
            class="hero-email-input flex-1 rounded-full border border-gray-200 px-5 py-3 text-[15px] text-apple-dark placeholder:text-apple-secondary/50 focus:outline-none focus:border-apple-blue focus:ring-1 focus:ring-apple-blue/30 transition-colors"
          />
          <button
            type="submit"
            class="bg-apple-dark text-white font-medium rounded-full px-7 py-3 text-[15px] hover:bg-black transition-colors active:scale-[0.97] cursor-pointer shrink-0"
          >
            Join Early Access
          </button>
        </form>
        <p class="hero-success mt-3 text-sm text-emerald-600 font-medium hidden">You're in! We'll be in touch soon.</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[13px] text-apple-secondary/60">Free to join. <strong class="text-apple-dark"><span class="signup-counter">0</span> have joined</strong>. We'll notify you when it's ready.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ THE GAP ════════ -->
    <section data-section="problem" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          Apple Health gives data points.<br/>Laso gives health context.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-[15px] md:text-base text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Heart rate, HRV, sleep, activity, and stress affect each other. Most apps show separate charts. Laso connects
          the signals so users know what is improving, what is declining, and what to do next.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-12 grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-5 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">59</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">HealthKit metrics in the product model</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:80ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">8</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">health categories scored together</p>
          </div>
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center" style="transition-delay:160ms">
            <p class="text-3xl font-semibold text-apple-dark">30+</p>
            <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">supported devices through Apple Health</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHAT LASO DOES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="solution" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          What users get from Laso every day.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Practical, health-first outcomes instead of generic wellness language.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500 to-cyan-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3v2.25m6.364.386-1.591 1.591M21 12h-2.25m-.386 6.364-1.591-1.591M12 18.75V21m-4.773-4.227-1.591 1.591M5.25 12H3m4.227-4.773L5.636 5.636M15.75 12a3.75 3.75 0 1 1-7.5 0 3.75 3.75 0 0 1 7.5 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Know daily readiness</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              A recovery and readiness score with category-level context, so users can adjust training and recovery that day.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:100ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-red-500 to-pink-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v3.75m-9.303 3.376c-.866 1.5.217 3.374 1.948 3.374h14.71c1.73 0 2.813-1.874 1.948-3.374L13.949 3.378c-.866-1.5-3.032-1.5-3.898 0L2.697 16.126ZM12 15.75h.007v.008H12v-.008Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Catch risk signals early</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Multi-metric risk and illness-warning style patterns are prioritized so users can act before health slips.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-7 text-center" style="transition-delay:200ms">
            <div class="w-14 h-14 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500 to-green-400 flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="1.5" class="w-7 h-7">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M2.036 12.322a1.012 1.012 0 0 1 0-.639C3.423 7.51 7.36 4.5 12 4.5c4.638 0 8.573 3.007 9.963 7.178.07.207.07.431 0 .639C20.577 16.49 16.64 19.5 12 19.5c-4.638 0-8.573-3.007-9.963-7.178Z"/><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 12a3 3 0 1 1-6 0 3 3 0 0 1 6 0Z"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
            <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-apple-dark">Improve with personalized actions</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-[15px] text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Sleep, strain, stress, and behavior guidance adapts to personal baselines and data depth.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ WHAT IS IN THE APP TODAY ════════ -->
    <section data-section="signature-engines" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          What is in Laso today.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          This is the actual product surface users see: Home, Explore, Live, Journal, and long-range review.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 lg:col-span-1">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Home Health Brief</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Recovery, Vitality Age, Sleep Coach, Strain, Stress, cycle card (opt-in), health risks, and daily action.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 lg:col-span-1" style="transition-delay:70ms">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Explore Intelligence</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Score breakdown, declining trends, top correlations, what-if simulation, and health state timeline.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 lg:col-span-1" style="transition-delay:140ms">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Live Monitoring</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Live vitals and activity streams with freshness/staleness handling and watch-state guidance.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 lg:col-span-1" style="transition-delay:210ms">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Journal + Correlations</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Quick log and expanded check-in. Laso discovers behavior-to-health correlations as entries accumulate.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-apple-gray rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6 md:col-span-2 lg:col-span-2" style="transition-delay:280ms">
            <h3 class="text-[16px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Weekly, Monthly, and Annual Review</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">
              Weekly review cards plus full monthly and annual reports for long-term trajectory, milestones, and trend context.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ SCORE SHOWCASE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="score" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-balance">
          One score, then the drivers behind it.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Laso scores health categories together and adapts to personal baselines, not one-size-fits-all averages.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 flex justify-center">
          <div class="score-showcase">
            <div class="score-glow" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="relative w-44 h-44 sm:w-56 sm:h-56 md:w-64 md:h-64 mx-auto">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 280 280" class="w-full h-full" aria-hidden="true">
                <defs>
                  <linearGradient id="ring-grad" x1="0%" y1="0%" x2="100%" y2="100%">
                    <stop offset="0%" stop-color="#0071e3"/>
                    <stop offset="40%" stop-color="#34d399"/>
                    <stop offset="100%" stop-color="#06b6d4"/>
                  </linearGradient>
                  <filter id="ring-glow">
                    <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="6" result="blur"/>
                    <feMerge><feMergeNode in="blur"/><feMergeNode in="SourceGraphic"/></feMerge>
                  </filter>
                </defs>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="#e8e8ed" stroke-width="12"/>
                <circle cx="140" cy="140" r="120" fill="none" stroke="url(#ring-grad)" stroke-width="12"
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-dasharray="753.98"
                  stroke-dashoffset="98"
                  filter="url(#ring-glow)"
                  class="origin-center -rotate-90 score-ring-animate"/>
              </svg>
              <div class="absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center">
                <span class="score-counter text-5xl sm:text-6xl md:text-7xl font-bold tracking-tight text-apple-dark" data-target="84">0</span>
                <span class="text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-apple-secondary mt-1">out of 100</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-3 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-red-500 rounded-full"></span> Heart</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:40ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-indigo-500 rounded-full"></span> Sleep</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:80ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-green-500 rounded-full"></span> Activity</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:120ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-orange-500 rounded-full"></span> Body</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:160ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-cyan-500 rounded-full"></span> Respiratory</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:200ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-purple-500 rounded-full"></span> Mindfulness</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:240ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-teal-500 rounded-full"></span> Mobility</span>
          <span class="section-reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white rounded-full px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-apple-dark" style="transition-delay:280ms"><span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-amber-600 rounded-full"></span> Nutrition</span>
        </div>

        <p class="section-reveal mt-6 text-xs text-apple-secondary/60">
          Sample visualization. User scores are generated from their own data and available metric depth.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ FEATURE COVERAGE ════════ -->
    <section data-section="features" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Feature coverage built into the current product.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Concrete modules, not placeholders.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-5">
          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Sleep Coach</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Sleep debt, consistency, recommended hours, bedtime and wake timing guidance.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Strain Coach</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Target strain range, zone guidance, strain balance (under/optimal/overreaching).</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Stress Monitor</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Stress score, key drivers (HRV and HR elevation), weekly trend, and breathwork path.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Risk + Illness Signals</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Needs-attention risks and pattern-based warnings when multiple metrics move together.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Correlations + Causal Insights</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Cross-metric relationships, declining trend detection, and causal-chain style explanations.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:180ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Vitality Age</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Age-based health estimate with trend context to support long-term improvement decisions.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:90ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Simulation + Health States</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">What-if simulation and health state timeline to preview impact and monitor trajectory.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:150ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Cycle Tracking (Opt-in)</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Female users can enable cycle-aware phase insights for sleep, recovery, and training guidance.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 p-6" style="transition-delay:210ms">
            <h3 class="text-[15px] font-semibold text-apple-dark">Reports</h3>
            <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm text-apple-secondary leading-relaxed">Weekly review plus full monthly and annual report experiences with sharable summaries.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ INSIGHT EXAMPLES ════════ -->
    <section data-section="insights" class="bg-apple-gray py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Example insight outputs users see.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-xl mx-auto">
          Product-style examples. Final insights are generated from each user's own history.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 space-y-4 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-red-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="#ef4444" class="w-4.5 h-4.5"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-apple-dark">"Resting heart rate is elevated versus baseline for 12 of the last 14 days."</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">Trend + baseline drift</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4" style="transition-delay:60ms">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-indigo-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="#6366f1" class="w-4.5 h-4.5"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-apple-dark">"Sleep under your target has coincided with lower next-day readiness in recent weeks."</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">Sleep-performance correlation</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4" style="transition-delay:120ms">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-emerald-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="#10b981" class="w-4.5 h-4.5"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-apple-dark">"Current strain is above your suggested range for today's recovery state; reduce intensity."</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">Strain coach recommendation</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4" style="transition-delay:180ms">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-cyan-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="#06b6d4" class="w-4.5 h-4.5"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-apple-dark">"High evening screen-time days in your journal align with shorter deep sleep."</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">Journal correlation discovery</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="section-reveal bg-white rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-4" style="transition-delay:240ms">
            <div class="w-9 h-9 rounded-xl bg-pink-50 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="#ec4899" class="w-4.5 h-4.5"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="4"/></svg>
            </div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-[15px] font-medium text-apple-dark">"Cycle phase indicates slower recovery this week; favor sleep and moderate load."</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-apple-secondary">Cycle-aware guidance (opt-in)</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ════════ HOW IT WORKS ════════ -->
    <section data-section="how-it-works" class="py-20 md:py-28 px-5">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <h2 class="section-reveal text-3xl md:text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-apple-dark text-center text-balance">
          Fast onboarding, then a simple daily loop.
        </h2>
        <p class="section-reveal mt-4 text-center text-apple-secondary text-[15px] md:text-base max-w-lg mx-auto">
          Connect data once, calibrate, then use Laso in minutes each day.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-14 grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 md:gap-6">
          <div class="section-reveal text-center">
